{"id":11483,"date":"2023-06-22T12:03:25","date_gmt":"2023-06-22T12:03:25","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?page_id=11483"},"modified":"2023-06-22T12:13:32","modified_gmt":"2023-06-22T12:13:32","slug":"laserova-thz-emisni-mikroskopie-ltem-v-blizkem-poli-snom","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/laserova-thz-emisni-mikroskopie-ltem-v-blizkem-poli-snom\/","title":{"rendered":"Laserov\u00e1 THz emisn\u00ed mikroskopie LTEM v bl\u00edzk\u00e9m poli (SNOM)"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"11483\" class=\"elementor elementor-11483\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-8a7068f elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"8a7068f\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-de951ca\" data-id=\"de951ca\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9b02534 elementor-widget elementor-widget-eael-adv-tabs\" data-id=\"9b02534\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"eael-adv-tabs.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t        <div data-scroll-on-click=\"no\" data-scroll-speed=\"300\" id=\"eael-advance-tabs-9b02534\" class=\"eael-advance-tabs eael-tabs-horizontal eael-tab-auto-active  active-caret-on responsive-vertical-layout\" data-tabid=\"9b02534\">\n            <div class=\"eael-tabs-nav\">\n                <ul class=\"\" role=\"tablist\">\n                                            <li id=\"popis-aplikace\" class=\"inactive eael-tab-item-trigger eael-tab-nav-item\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"popis-aplikace-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >Popis aplikace<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                            <li id=\"aplikace\" class=\"inactive eael-tab-item-trigger eael-tab-nav-item\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"aplikace-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >Aplikace<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                    <\/ul>\n            <\/div>\n            \n            <div class=\"eael-tabs-content\">\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"popis-aplikace-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"popis-aplikace-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <p><strong>Laserov\u00e1 THz emisn\u00ed mikroskopie LTEM (Laser THz emission microscopy) v\u00a0bl\u00edzk\u00e9m poli (<a href=\"https:\/\/www.neaspec.com\/\">SNOM<\/a>)<\/strong><\/p><p>Terahertzov\u00e9 z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed je elektromagnetick\u00e9 vln\u011bn\u00ed, kter\u00e9 se nach\u00e1z\u00ed mezi mikrovlnn\u00fdm a infra\u010derven\u00fdm z\u00e1\u0159en\u00edm, s frekvencemi \u0159\u00e1du desetin Terahertz (0,1 THz odpov\u00edd\u00e1 vlnov\u00e9 d\u00e9lce 3 mm) a\u017e \u0159\u00e1du des\u00edtek THz (10 THz odpov\u00edd\u00e1 vlnov\u00e9 d\u00e9lce 30 \u00b5m); Obr\u00e1zek 1. Toto z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed na pomez\u00ed optiky\/fotoniky a elektroniky na\u0161lo uplatn\u011bn\u00ed v mnoha v\u011bdn\u00edch oborech a praktick\u00fdch aplikac\u00edch. M\u016f\u017eeme uv\u00e9st nap\u0159\u00edklad l\u00e9ka\u0159stv\u00ed (od v\u00fdzkumu rakoviny a\u017e po anal\u00fdzu DNA), p\u0159\u00edrodn\u00ed v\u011bdy (v\u00fdzkum vlastnost\u00ed pevn\u00fdch l\u00e1tek jako supravodivost, magnetorezistence \u010di transportn\u00ed jevy; v p\u0159\u00edpad\u011b \u010dasov\u011b rozli\u0161iteln\u00e9 THz spektroskopie lze dokonce zkoumat fyzik\u00e1ln\u00ed podstatu zm\u00edn\u011bn\u00fdch jev\u016f), forenzn\u00ed anal\u00fdzu \u010di ov\u011b\u0159ov\u00e1n\u00ed kvality v\u00fdrobk\u016f, a tak\u00e9 zkoum\u00e1n\u00ed jev\u016f, s nimi\u017e pracuje nap\u0159. spintronika, zkoumaj\u00edc\u00ed mo\u017enosti uchov\u00e1n\u00ed a p\u0159enosu informace prost\u0159ednictv\u00edm spinu elektron\u016f.<\/p><p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-11476 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2023\/06\/3ca33145.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"709\" height=\"408\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2023\/06\/3ca33145.png 709w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2023\/06\/3ca33145-300x173.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 709px) 100vw, 709px\" \/><\/p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>Obr\u00e1zek 1: Elektromagnetick\u00e9 spektrum <br \/>(William Ghann and Jamal Uddin: Terahertz (THz) Spectroscopy: A Cutting\u2010Edge Technology)<\/em><\/p><p><strong>THz emisn\u00ed spektroskopie (TES) <\/strong>je relativn\u011b nov\u00e1 metoda modern\u00ed spektroskopie, kter\u00e1 ke zkoum\u00e1n\u00ed materi\u00e1l\u016f pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 THz vlny. Ve v\u011bt\u0161in\u011b p\u0159\u00edpad\u016f je zde zdrojem THz z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed samotn\u00fd m\u011b\u0159en\u00fd vzorek; d\u00edky tzv. budic\u00edmu z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed. S emitovan\u00fdmi THz vlnami lze z\u00edskat jednak informace o procesu zodpov\u011bdn\u00e9m za tuto emisi (optick\u00e9 usm\u011brn\u011bn\u00ed, shift currents, charge transfer atd.), ale i dal\u0161\u00edch procesech, kter\u00e9 mohou naopak pr\u00e1v\u011b \u201esout\u011b\u017eit\u201c s generov\u00e1n\u00edm THz vln, a br\u00e1nit tak emisi THz z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed vzorkem.<\/p><p><strong>Laserov\u00e1 THz (terahertzov\u00e1) emisn\u00ed mikroskopie (LTEM)<\/strong>, modern\u00ed varianta t\u00e9to technologie, je metoda tzv. imagingu, kter\u00e1 se stala v\u00a0posledn\u00edch n\u011bkolika letech siln\u00fdm n\u00e1strojem pro studium a lokalizaci elektrick\u00fdch poruch v\u00a0integrovan\u00fdch obvodech, v\u00fdzkum a kontrolu kvality fotovodi\u010d\u016f, neline\u00e1rn\u00edch optick\u00fdch krystal\u016f (ZnTe, GaP atd.), hodnocen\u00ed vlastnost\u00ed povrch\u016f a rozhran\u00ed v\u00a0syst\u00e9mech na b\u00e1zi k\u0159em\u00edku jako nap\u0159. Si-MOS, v\u00fdzkum polovodi\u010d\u016f na b\u00e1zi perovskit\u016f atd.<\/p><p>Buzen\u00ed THz z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed ve vzorku se obvykle d\u011bje pomoc\u00ed fotoexcitace ultra-rychl\u00fdm pulzn\u00edm laserem; m\u011b\u0159ic\u00ed syst\u00e9m n\u00e1sledn\u011b detekuje lok\u00e1ln\u00ed variace emitovan\u00e9ho THz z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed s\u00a0velmi vysok\u00fdm prostorov\u00fdm rozli\u0161en\u00edm. Toto rozli\u0161en\u00ed je obvykle men\u0161\u00ed ne\u017e 1 mikron a je z\u00e1visl\u00e9 zejm\u00e9na na fokusaci excita\u010dn\u00edho laserov\u00e9ho paprsku, nap\u0159. pomoc\u00ed pou\u017eit\u00e9ho objektivu. Dal\u0161\u00edm revolu\u010dn\u00edm krokem pro radik\u00e1ln\u00ed zv\u00fd\u0161en\u00ed prostorov\u00e9ho rozli\u0161en\u00ed LTEM imagingu je kombinace t\u00e9to techniky m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed s\u00a0technologi\u00ed s-SNOM. Tato m\u011b\u0159ic\u00ed technika kombinuje klasickou AFM (mikroskopii atom\u00e1rn\u00edch sil) se spektroskopi\u00ed. Elektromagnetick\u00e9 z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed (excita\u010dn\u00ed) je fokusov\u00e1no na ostr\u00fd kovov\u00fd AFM hrot (tip) um\u00edst\u011bn\u00fd v\u00a0nano-vzd\u00e1lenosti od povrchu vzorku a b\u011bhem automatick\u00e9ho mapov\u00e1n\u00ed se krom\u011b jin\u00e9ho detekuje i rozpt\u00fdlen\u00e9 z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed. Pou\u017eit\u00fd AFM tip tedy funguje jako nano-sonda a prostorov\u00e9 rozli\u0161en\u00ed je pak p\u0159\u00edmo z\u00e1visl\u00e9 na jej\u00ed velikosti. s-SNOM m\u00e1 velmi v\u00fdznamn\u00fd dopad zejm\u00e9na v\u00a0anal\u00fdz\u00e1ch, kter\u00e9 pou\u017e\u00edvaj\u00ed infra\u010dervenou oblast spektra, kde ji lze pova\u017eovat za klasickou infra\u010dervenou (IR, FT-IR) mikroskopii, av\u0161ak s\u00a0v\u00fdjime\u010dn\u00fdm prostorov\u00fdm rozli\u0161en\u00edm pod 10 nanometr\u016f.<\/p><p>Spojen\u00ed kr\u00e1tkovlnn\u00e9ho THz z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed s AFM hrotem v nanom\u011b\u0159\u00edtku je v\u0161ak velmi n\u00e1ro\u010dn\u00e9, co\u017e obvykle br\u00e1n\u00ed studiu nov\u00fdch polovodi\u010dov\u00fdch materi\u00e1l\u016f s velkou \u0161\u00ed\u0159kou tzv. zak\u00e1zan\u00e9ho p\u00e1su (band gap) &#8211; p\u0159edev\u0161\u00edm struktur jako GaN\/AlGaN\/AlN\/Si atd. V <a href=\"https:\/\/www.nature.com\/articles\/s41377-023-01137-y\"><strong>t\u00e9to studii<\/strong><\/a> bylo dosa\u017eeno prvn\u00edho \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u00e9ho m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed pomoc\u00ed kombinace zobrazovac\u00edch technik LTEM a THz s-SNOM za pou\u017eit\u00ed vy\u0161\u0161\u00ed energie ne\u017e 3 eV, co\u017e zde umo\u017e\u0148uje pou\u017eit\u00ed vysoce p\u0159esn\u011b fokusovan\u00e9ho modr\u00e9ho laseru (410 nm femtosekundov\u00fd pulzn\u00ed laser) pro z\u00edsk\u00e1n\u00ed prostorov\u00e9ho rozli\u0161en\u00ed v \u0159\u00e1du nanometr\u016f (Obr\u00e1zek 2).<\/p><p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-11478 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2023\/06\/511bcd1b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"914\" height=\"445\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2023\/06\/511bcd1b.png 914w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2023\/06\/511bcd1b-300x146.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2023\/06\/511bcd1b-768x374.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 914px) 100vw, 914px\" \/><\/p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>Obr\u00e1zek 2: NIR z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed (820 nm), modr\u00e9 z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed (410 nm) a THz z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed jsou generov\u00e1ny samostatn\u011b, THz pulsy pomoc\u00ed konven\u010dn\u00ed fotovodiv\u00e9 ant\u00e9ny (PCA). V\u0161echny t\u0159i paprsky se pak v\u00a0jednom bod\u011b sb\u00edhaj\u00ed a fokusuj\u00ed na AFM hrot. Rozpt\u00fdlen\u00e9 a vzorkem emitovan\u00e9 THz pulzy jsou koherentn\u011b detekov\u00e1ny metodou elektrooptick\u00e9ho vzorkov\u00e1n\u00ed (EOS)<\/em><\/p><p>V\u00fdsledkem t\u00e9to kombinovan\u00e9 techniky je pak imaging vzork\u016f (a p\u0159\u00edslu\u0161n\u00e1 spektra) a tak\u00e9 soub\u011b\u017en\u011b LTEM obraz THz vln generovan\u00fdch vzorkem. P\u0159i pou\u017eit\u00ed excitace 410\u2009nm zde tedy generujeme terahertzov\u00e9 pulzy p\u0159\u00edmo z\u00a0pou\u017eit\u00e9ho vzorku k\u0159em\u00edku (bulk single-crystal), p\u0159i\u010dem\u017e tento typ vzorku obvykle nem\u00e1 zaj\u00edmavou emisi THz z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed p\u0159i excitaci v\u00a0oblasti NIR (bl\u00edzk\u00e1 infra\u010derven\u00e1 oblast). Pou\u017eit\u00fd vzorek k\u0159em\u00edku byl p\u0159ed m\u011b\u0159en\u00edm podroben iontov\u00e9 implantaci b\u00f3ru s\u00a0n\u00e1slednou tepelnou \u00fapravou (annealingem) p\u0159\u00edm\u011bsi v\u00a0oblasti implantace, vzorek tedy po \u00faprav\u011b obsahuje dv\u011b oblasti velmi rozd\u00edln\u00fdch hustot dopingu, s relativn\u011b ostrou hranic\u00ed mezi nimi. \u00a0Neimplantovan\u00e1 oblast je jednodu\u0161e nemodifikovan\u00fd Si substr\u00e1t, kter\u00fd je jen lehce n-dopovan\u00fd (koncentrace cca 10<sup>16<\/sup>\u2009cm<sup>-3<\/sup>), zat\u00edmco b\u00f3rem implantovan\u00e1 oblast je p-dopovan\u00e1, s vy\u0161\u0161\u00ed nomin\u00e1ln\u00ed hustotou dotov\u00e1n\u00ed (asi 10<sup>18<\/sup>\u2009cm<sup>-3<\/sup>). N\u00e1sleduj\u00edc\u00ed Obr\u00e1zek 3 popisuje jeden z\u00a0mnoha v\u00fdstup\u016f z\u00a0tohoto experimentu.<\/p><